## What players say after looking at a profile (run 2026-10-20; the owner: "AI players will REALLY CHECK each others'
## profiles especially the player and will react according to the player's profile, averages, last 3-5 games ...
## THEY WILL ACKNOWLEDGE IF YOU PLAYED GOOD, but some trolls will still troll you ... Averages are so important in this
## toxic community. I need this to be toxic as ever, but also with more kind people around"). ProfileTalk picks the
## situation by who is looking and what the profile shows; ChatMind.pick reads these like its own lists.
## Fields: {name} the profile's player, {kda} average K/D/A, {d} average deaths, {wr} win rate %, {w5} / {l5} wins and
## losses of the last 5, {last} the last match's K/D/A, {lhero} its hero, {lh} average last hits, {lhm} last hits a
## minute, {gpm}, {mvps}, {rp} rampages, {tr} triple kills, {fb} first bloods, {lane} favourite lane, {rank}, {games},
## {n} a count the moment gives.

